  "releaseNotes": "#### ⚙️ Modifications\n- Improved random file path method performance\n- Optimized CountNumberOfDigits for common numeric types (25–30× speedup on 100M random int calls)\n- Return -1 for NaN and Infinity inputs in CountNumberOfDigits\n\n#### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n- Fixed GracefulParse overflow when version components exceeded Int32.MaxValue after sanitization\n- Fixed random walker infinite loop on reparse-point cycles",
